  "remarks": "Oleg Trofimov has served as Acting Minister of Education and Science of the so-called “Donetsk People’s Republic” since 31 August 2024 and exercises executive authority over the education system in the so-called “Donetsk People’s Republic”. As a Deputy Chairperson of the Interdepartmental Coordinating Council on preparation for military service and military-patriotic education, Oleg Trofimov participates in the coordination of policies targeting minors on the territory of Ukraine in respect of their indoctrination and militarised education. Under Oleg Trofimov’s leadership, the Ministry of Education and Science introduced state-approved history textbooks for all grades and is currently in the process of creating a unified textbook on the history of Donbas and Novorossiya. Furthermore, the Ministry of Education and Science has been promoting educational programmes designed to instil loyalty to the Russian state, its military, and its historical and cultural narratives. Oleg Trofimov has supported the institutionalisation of military-patriotic instruction, cooperation with paramilitary youth organisations, and the integration of pre-military training and military-sports activities into schools.",
